BEHAVIOR add-int

DESCRIPTION
  Adds two signed 64-bit integers and returns the sum. Used by compositions to
  compute lengths (which may not compute themselves).

CONTRACT
  INPUT a int 8
  INPUT b int 8
  OUTPUT result int 8
  GUARANTEES pure no_alloc writes_output

HASH 506d7b8d

IMPLEMENTATION
  va = LOAD a 8
  vb = LOAD b 8
  s = IADD va vb 8
  STORE result s 8
END
